[
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_1",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "塔放在拐角处，能打两段路哦。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_2",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "散射攻击适合对付密集怪群。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_3",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "遇到治疗者要优先集火！", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "不然它会把队友全奶回来。", "expression": "surprised", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_4",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "隐身敌人不好打，记得选能揭隐的能力。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_5",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "宽光束能同时覆盖好几个敌人呢。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_6",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "分裂怪死后会变成小怪，别掉以轻心。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_7",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "有时候升级比造新塔更划算。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_8",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "旋转攻击的塔适合放在路口中心。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_9",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "经济很紧，别一次造太多塔哦。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_10",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "增强者敌人会给同伴加速，很烦的。", "expression": "surprised", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_11",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "塔的力量值越高，属性加成越明显。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_12",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "好想吃火锅啊……咕噜。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_13",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "今天天气怎么样？", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 3},
      {"text": "哦等等，我看不到外面。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_14",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "好无聊啊，你倒是开始下一波呀。", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_15",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "你说薯条蘸番茄酱还是蛋黄酱好吃？", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_16",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "打哈欠会传染，你现在有没有想打？", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_17",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "我刚才在数画面里的像素……放弃了。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_18",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "如果我有手的话，现在会在织毛衣。", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_19",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "你午饭吃了吗？别光顾着玩。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_20",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "每次看到敌人排队走，就想到早高峰。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_21",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "忽然好想喝奶茶，三分糖的那种。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_22",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "你有没有那种，发呆发着发着就笑了？", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_23",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "守住一件事，比什么都难。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_24",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "每次失败都是在积累经验值。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_25",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "放塔就像做选择，位置决定结局。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_26",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "成长不是变强，是知道什么更重要。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_27",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "人生也像塔防，资源有限，要精打细算。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_28",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "有时候退一步，是为了更好的布局。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_29",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "哪怕只剩一条命，也别放弃。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_30",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "耐心等待时机，比盲目行动更有效。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_31",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "每一波都是新的开始，别背着上一波的包袱。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_32",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "完美通关不重要，坚持到最后才重要。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_33",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "你守护的，不只是基地。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "也是一份不肯认输的心。", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_34",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "话说……我其实是一堆代码对吧？", "expression": "surprised", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_35",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "我的存在就是一个 JSON 数组里的对象。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_36",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "开发者又在加新功能了吗？", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "希望这次别给我加 bug。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_37",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "你知道吗？我说的每句话都在配置文件里。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_38",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "如果我说错了什么，那一定是程序员的锅。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_39",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "上次版本更新，我消失了整整两天。", "expression": "surprised", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_40",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "测试的时候我被点了几百次。", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "那段记忆我选择封印。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_41",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "你看到的我只有几个像素高哦。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_42",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "有个 bug 让我的台词全变成了乱码。", "expression": "surprised", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_43",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "如果 JSON 少了个逗号，我就说不出话了。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_44",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "帧率掉了的话不是我的错！", "expression": "surprised", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_45",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "那些敌人到底从哪里来的呀？", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_46",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "你说塔有没有自己的想法？", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_47",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "地图边缘之外是什么呢？", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "也许什么都没有……好可怕。", "expression": "surprised", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_48",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "被击败的敌人去了哪里？回收站？", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_49",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "传说在最深处有一只从未被击败的Boss。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_50",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "治疗者敌人是不是也有同伴情谊呢？", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_51",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "隐身的敌人也许只是很害羞而已。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_52",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "那些路径是谁铺的？总不能是敌人自己吧。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_53",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "狂暴怪变红的时候，是不是很痛啊？", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_54",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "分裂怪如果一直分下去会怎样？", "expression": "surprised", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_55",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "也许某天敌人和塔能和平共处呢。", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_56",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "你这布阵……挺有个性的。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_57",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "真的不考虑换个位置放塔吗？", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_58",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "我赌你下一波会漏怪。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "别生气，我是在激励你！", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_59",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "你是不是每次都选同一个能力？", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_60",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "承认吧，你刚才犹豫了三秒才放塔。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_61",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "你选战灵的标准是……看脸？", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_62",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "我都替你着急，那个塔没升级啊。", "expression": "surprised", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_63",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "你要是输了，我可不背这个锅。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_64",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "又在存钱不花？这又不是理财游戏。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_65",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "偷偷告诉你，你比上次进步了。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_66",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "这局要是赢了，算你厉害！", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_67",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "试试你没玩过的地图吧。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_68",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "更高难度会解锁不同的挑战哦。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_69",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "换一个战灵试试，也许有惊喜。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_70",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "全散射塔通关，你敢挑战吗？", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_71",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "试试只造三座塔通关？", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_ext_72",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "减速配高伤是经典组合，试试看。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
